    "It fills itself with whatever matches, and goes on filling itself. Try `title:Swift` or `is:unread`." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elle se remplit de tout ce qui correspond, et continue de se remplir. Essayez `title:Swift` ou `is:unread`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept on your own devices, through your iCloud. Flong has no account and nowhere to send them." : {
